WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:26.030
Perfect Machine King's overwhelming attack points have cornered Otogi and Shizuka.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:29.680
But Jonouchi inspires Shizuka.

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:36.440
She uses Otogi and Honda's cards to defeat The Big Five.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.660
But Honda doesn't return.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:46.020
Mokuba Kidnapped
Kaiba vs Jinzo

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.700
Huh?  What?

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.670
My field of vision is low.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:05.940
Hi!

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:14.410
Honda...

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:19.340
Their goal is to steal our bodies.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.790
So Honda hasn't been erased.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.500
Yeah.  He may be nearby.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.240
Let's split up and find him.

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.300
Honda!  Where's everyone?

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:54.290
What's gotten into you?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:58.690
Kaiba, I despise you!

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.220
What do you mean?

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:01.640
Enough talk!

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.800
Over here!

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:09.840
Honda!

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:10.840
Honda!

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:12.150
Yugi!

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:15.910
Honda!  You're okay!

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:16.870
Thank goodness!

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.480
Uninvited guests.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:21.710
I get it!

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.880
He's not Honda.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:25.860
What do you mean?

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:27.720
It can't be!

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:33.490
Yes.  I'm Soichiro Ota, one of The Big Five.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.740
I took this body!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.260
I'm a 5th-degree kendo master.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:48.830
I'll end you!

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:50.710
What is it?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.040
Jonouchi!

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:56.640
Damn!

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.870
Come to your senses, Honda!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.480
You went too far!

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.420
Honda!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.000
Honda!  Are you all right?

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:15.800
Big brother!

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:21.270
Kaiba!  I'm taking your loved one!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:23.010
Ota!  How dare you!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.330
Wait, Honda!

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.210
Honda!

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:28.660
Honda!

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:35.890
Kaiba.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:40.420
Damn.  Is Honda really possessed?

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.550
Honda...

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:44.900
Oh yeah.  Just now...

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:49.040
What is this?

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:52.320
Did someone make this robot?

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:53.860
Watch out, Shizuka.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.880
It may be a trap.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:05:00.150
In this world, you may be right.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.950
We should destroy it, just in case.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:06.690
Wait.  It's on our side.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:08.630
How do you know?

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:11.190
Because it tried to help Kaiba.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:12.930
That's true, but...

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:14.930
You're on our side.  Right?

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.160
If you say so.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.160
She saved your life.

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:25.280
Let's go after Kaiba.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:30.040
He must know where the real Honda is.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:32.360
Be quiet!

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.080
I'll break you if you don't calm down!

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:35.810
Brother!

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.280
Just wait, Mokuba.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.510
Long time no see, Seto Kaiba.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:09.510
Who are you?

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:13.250
You've forgotten me?

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:16.260
What did you do with Mokuba?

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:17.620
Mokuba?

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:22.860
Come to think of it, a motorcycle with a filthy kid just passed by.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:32.570
Noa.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.000
Ota, why do you have him?

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:37.940
I'm using him to lure Kaiba.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.540
I said no dirty tricks.

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:43.760
But my companions have lost.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.980
I must do whatever it takes.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.480
No excuses.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:50.280
I'll take the boy.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:50.990
But...

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.690
You disobey me?

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:58.140
Taking Mokuba hostage is cheating!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.740
How can you say that to me?

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:02.770
What?

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.350
Where am I?

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:11.540
You're awake.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:15.140
You!

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.350
What will you do to me?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:21.160
How upsetting.  I saved you.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:24.450
What?  Then return me to my brother!

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:27.810
No need to hurry.  Look.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:30.640
Big brother!

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:34.260
Your brother's duel is about to begin.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.400
He's going to duel?

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:40.900
You must defeat me to get to Mokuba.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:45.600
Don't make me laugh.  You're no match for me.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:49.080
Fine.  I accept your challenge!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.450
Build your deck, Seto.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:56.950
But you won't find any God Cards.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:59.130
They're banned.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.980
When you finish building your deck, pick your Deck Master.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:07.560
My Deck Master is...

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.970
Lord of D.!

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:14.200
My Deck Master is...

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.970
I'll let you know later.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:21.480
Because you'll be too shocked.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.480
Bluffs don't work on me.

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:30.990
If you're unafraid of the blue flame burning inside me, bring it on!

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.410
Here I go!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.110
Duel!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:39.060
I'll go first.  My turn.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.310
A monster in defense position.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:45.870
And I set two cards and end my turn.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.370
My turn!  I draw a card!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.970
I summon Spear Dragon!

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:52.800
Spear Dragon.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:09:00.250
Even if I have a monster in defense position, his card can deal piercing damage.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:03.560
Defending monsters can't stop me!

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.650
Go, Spear Dragon!

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:07.760
Dragon Screw!

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:15.630
What?

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:21.640
Since you destroyed Hiro's Shadow Scout, you must draw three cards from your deck.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:25.640
And discard any spell card you drew.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:29.030
Discard your two spell cards.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.330
But I'll set a card.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:39.820
My set card is Crush Card Virus.

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:43.360
I'll end this quickly, Daimon.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:47.440
I activate a trap card.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:49.360
Solemn Wishes!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.730
My turn.  I draw a card.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:57.740
Solemn Wishes restores 500 life points every time I draw a card.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:03.410
Due to its effect, my life points return to 3100.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:07.600
But Daimon, your deck will only survive for one more turn.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:10.920
I'll deal fatal damage next turn.

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:14.160
I set a monster card in defense position.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:17.160
And I set one card.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.160
I end my turn.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:20.660
Strange.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:27.000
Spear Dragon automatically switches to defense position after it attacks.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.170
It has 0 defense points.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:32.170
So why isn't he attacking it?

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:36.280
Attack me.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:40.660
I don't know what he's planning, but he's finished.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.020
My turn!

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:44.340
I summon Giant Germ!

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:48.290
And I switch Spear Dragon to attack position!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.530
Spear Dragon, attack his monster!

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:53.300
Not good enough, Seto!

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:55.230
I activate my trap card!

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:57.300
Mask of Perplexity!

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:02.720
I caught you!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:09.280
Mask of Perplexity temporarily paralyzes your brain and switches your attack target.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:10.450
Big brother!

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:18.720
You can't tell your enemies apart from your allies.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.720
Spear Dragon, attack that card!

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:31.080
What?

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.660
Too bad.

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:38.070
Spear Dragon attacked your own monster, Giant Germ.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:43.020
But you'll be the one to cry.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:49.720
I use Giant Germ to activate the trap card, Crush Card Virus!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.160
What?

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:57.700
Impossible!  Why was my trap card destroyed?

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:00.360
Can it be?  Is your Deck Master...

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:02.640
Exactly.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.370
My Deck Master is...

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.080
Jinzo!

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:12.180
My Deck Master's ability seals away your traps.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:18.300
Seto Kaiba, your trap cards will never activate!

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:39.780
I sold Kaiba Corporation weapons to many military superpowers.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:44.140
The virtual system you invented was a big hit.

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:51.480
Somewhere in the world, your invention is still used as a tool for war.

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:53.240
That's why I-

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:56.490
Drove Gozaburo Kaiba to death?

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:59.050
It all started on your birthday.

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:02.990
Gozaburo's present was a mistake.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:05.990
As of today...

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:10.530
Seto, you completed your education.

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:12.230
Congratulations.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:14.650
Today is your birthday.

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:17.110
I have a present for you.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.970
Take it.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:25.820
Seto, Mokuba.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:31.250
I give you each a 2% share of Kaiba Corporation.

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.720
And Seto.

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:37.020
I'm loaning you one billion yen.

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:37.960
Loan?

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:43.960
Yes.  Your yearlong final test starts now.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.900
Make 100 times the money back within a year.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:54.210
If you can't do that, you can't inherit Kaiba Corporation.

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:57.710
Sign the loan.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:00.710
Or do you want to return to the orphanage?

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:12.510
Good.  Daimon will serve as your aide.

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:16.400
I look foward to a year from now.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.880
Big brother, what will you do?

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:24.870
I have no clue how to make money through business.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:28.240
Stay calm.  This is a game.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.750
Here are 100 cards.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.280
Each card represents 1% of the stock.

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:35.250
A share.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.730
A company has rules.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:43.130
Whoever holds the most cards will control the company.

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:45.860
Holds the most cards?

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.860
In other words, 51 cards.

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:54.100
If you hold 51 out of 100 cards, no one has more cards than you.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:55.470
You win the game.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:15:02.680
Daimon, use all the money to purchase 51% of a company's stock.

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.610
All the money?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.880
A company with status and tradition.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:11.770
Enter.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.950
Mr. Seto, we bought a company.

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:20.420
We bought a 300 year-old porcelain company.

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:24.830
Wow!  Big brother, you're now the president of this company!

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:28.970
This company isn't very profitable.

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:32.710
Its value won't increase hundredfold in a year.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:36.940
But I can make it worth several times as much quickly.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:39.780
What?

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:42.750
Buy back my stock at 5 times the price?

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:47.850
If you won't, you and the rest of your employees are fired.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:51.360
You're so cruel!

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:57.360
Your talent in making money surpassed Gozaburo's expectations.

00:15:57.360 --> 00:16:04.760
Gozaburo applied my virtual system to military weapons, crushing my dreams.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:11.500
I promised myself that I would use and surpass him.

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:13.730
But it's over now.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:16.320
Your dream ends here.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:17.620
Not yet!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:24.220
I activate Giant Germ's effect to summon another copy from my deck.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:32.230
Seto, after spending a year with you, I know exactly how you think.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:38.020
Since you can't use traps, your deck will rely on force to break through.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.890
But I believe in my deck!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.240
My turn.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:47.580
Due to Solemn Wishes's effect, I regain 500 life points.

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:51.820
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.050
My turn!

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:54.290
I draw a card!

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:58.860
Spear Dragon, attack his defending monster!

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:01.230
Dragon Screw!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:06.700
Cyber Jar's effect activates.

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:10.040
All monsters on the field are destroyed.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.410
What?

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:25.310
Then we both draw five cards from our decks.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:28.690
Any monsters among them are placed on the field.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:37.460
It's a restart.

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:38.370
Big brother!

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:39.970
My turn.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:44.440
Solemn Wishes gives me 500 life points.

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:48.210
I play the spell card, Watch Tranquilizer.

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:59.220
When Gozaburo was in charge, Kaiba Corporation designed this weapon.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:03.090
Allow me to test it out.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:04.820
You're first!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:06.020
Fire!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:13.880
The spell card Watch Tranquilizer lowers its attack points by 100 for every Level.

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:19.540
Vorse Raider is Level 4, so it loses 400 attack points.

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:24.040
But he only has a monster with 400 attack points.

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:29.320
I activate Injection Fairy Lily's effect.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:35.150
By paying 2000 life points, Lily gains 3000 attack points!

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.760
3400 attack points?

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.490
Go!  Lily!

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:42.990
Seto Kaiba, time for a checkup!

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:44.460
Injection!

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.480
I activate a spell card!

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.530
Sebek's Blessing!

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:58.650
Due to Sebek's Blessing, I regain life points equal to the damage I dealt.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:02.650
I now have an overwhelming advantage.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:06.860
I set a monster in defense position.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.520
I end my turn.

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:09.920
My turn!

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:16.160
Lily is back down to 400 attack points.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.170
The Wicked Worm Beast has 1400 attack points.

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:23.420
If it gets through, he'll lose a lot of life points.

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:24.170
But...

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:28.600
If he uses Lily's effect to raise her attack points...

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.180
...I'll be hurt instead, and I'll have 0 life points.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:35.950
I must endure this, just like how I've endured all my life's hardships.

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:39.680
I set a monster in defense position!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.000
You're not attacking?

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:47.100
Then I'll activate my trap before your turn ends.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:49.090
Life Absorbing Machine!

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:56.480
Life Absorbing Machine gives him back half the life points he paid last turn.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:20:00.970
With a powerful life regeneration combo, he can keep attacking with Lily!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.600
My turn.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:08.010
Due to Solemn Wishes and Life Absorbing Machine, I regain life points.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:15.250
Seto, I'll show you the strongest weapon that Gozaburo created.

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:21.260
I tribute my monster in defense position to summon this monster!

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:30.300
What's that?

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:38.780
How long is this road?

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.780
It's good that it's the only road.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:43.720
We won't lose sight of-

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:49.790
What's wrong, Jonouchi?

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:52.060
Yugi, look.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:54.890
What is that?

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:50.010
Due to Deck Master Jinzo, Kaiba can't use trap cards.

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:54.460
And Imperial Order won't let him use spell cards either.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:22:01.390
Kaiba is at a horrible disadvantage, and Satellite Cannon is aiming at him from above!

00:22:01.390 --> 00:22:04.730
Is there any way for Kaiba to counterattack?

00:22:04.730 --> 00:22:08.770
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Attack From Space
Satellite Cannon

00:22:08.770 --> 00:22:10.440
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:21.690
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:30.640
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:35.610
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.610 --> 00:22:39.580
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:40.010 --> 00:22:47.550
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:51.120
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:51.120 --> 00:22:55.890
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.890 --> 00:23:06.000
And walk it without stopping

00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:13.610
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:22.580
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:30.560
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:40.400
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
